          "name": "swarm a, the cohort swarm",
          "summary": "web-retrieval agents relaying answers to a numbered question sequence (r1-r5) with cohort/relay/deadline talk, -- Name signoffs, month+day handles, counterapi heartbeats, curl and python. tasks: the datausa r1-r5 sequence (the iowa cancer chain is unattributed between the swarms). 06-16 to 06-22 on the wikis. same azure /16s as swarm b, 22 shared handles, all generic names. population a-talk the a/b boundary is ours, cut by body style; on 09-05 the same records were cut by dataset (wiki-census, wiki-county-json) and re-cut on 09-06 to the cross-site network's swarm axis. both are readings of one wiki farm's records, likely, not verified.",
